{"duration": 35.163, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Union surgeon flings a cloth triangle over a bleeding arm, eyes fierce.", "start": 0.08, "end": 4.097}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Fellow medics laugh, muttering that a rag cannot stop a cannon\u2011shot wound.", "start": 4.517, "end": 8.444}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Barnes storms the battlefield, smoke curling around him.", "start": 8.864, "end": 11.8}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He pulls a right\u2011angled piece of cloth from his satchel.", "start": 12.02, "end": 14.81}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it feels like folding a napkin into a quick sling when dinner is late.", "start": 15.23, "end": 19.204}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Barnes adopts the triangular cloth so a medic can wrap, tie, and support a wound in three swift moves.", "start": 19.624, "end": 25.531}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The fold saves minutes and cuts the chance of a tangled dressing.", "start": 25.751, "end": 29.063}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That same triangle later became the Scout\u2019s neckerchief, born on Civil War fields.", "start": 29.483, "end": 34.043}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.124, "end": 0.174, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Union", "start": 0.224, "end": 0.524, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "surgeon", "start": 0.574, "end": 0.999, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "flings", "start": 1.074, "end": 1.299, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.324, "end": 1.349, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "cloth", "start": 1.399, "end": 1.649, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "triangle", "start": 1.699, "end": 2.199, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "over", "start": 2.224, "end": 2.374, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 2.399, "end": 2.424, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "bleeding", "start": 2.474, "end": 2.774, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "arm,", "start": 2.824, "end": 3.349, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "eyes", "start": 3.399, "end": 3.674, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "fierce.", "start": 3.724, "end": 4.112, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w"